-- =============================================================================
-- campaign_library_seed.sql — CAMPAIGN_LIBRARY seed data
--
-- 100 historical campaigns for the Apex Athletics content supply chain demo.
--
-- WHY THIS IS A SEED FILE:
-- The copy text in these rows (SUBJECT_LINE, BODY_PREVIEW, CTA_TEXT) was
-- originally generated with SNOWFLAKE.CORTEX.COMPLETE — roughly 300 calls at
-- setup time. That made every run non-deterministic, added unpredictable token
-- spend, and broke outright when a model name was deprecated. The output was
-- generated once and frozen here so setup is fast, free, and repeatable, and so
-- the guide can state expected results.
--
-- Run AFTER the CAMPAIGN_LIBRARY table is created in 03_data_model.sql.
-- Idempotent: truncates before inserting.
--
-- To regenerate this file from a live table, see REGENERATING below.
-- =============================================================================

